  "description": "(3.5.0) De-Googled casting for CircleAI — fling generated media/decks to a smart TV over open UPnP/DLNA on the LAN. No Google Cast / Chromecast SDK, no cloud. Seams: ICastTarget (SSDP discovery), ICastSession (AVTransport push), ILocalMediaHost (pure-managed HTTP media host with Range), IDocumentCastAdapter (rasteriser seam). Pure BCL, zero external dependencies.",
